      VB (owner, 11 Oct 2026): app script tags we don't want, taken out of Shopify's script-tag list here because the
      apps can't remove them themselves. Each string is the exact entry with its comma (both with & and with Shopify's \u0026 escape), so if Shopify ever
      changes the format nothing matches and the page is unchanged.
      - Trustpilot: we don't use its widgets (review invitations are sent by Trustpilot's servers and are unaffected).
      - BOGOS: two old "secomapp" script tags duplicate the BOGOS app embed, which stays on.
      - Zigpoll: not needed on the homepage; stays on every other page.
